@startuml
title 服务 listen / accept 流程时序

actor "Lua服务\n业务脚本" as Lua
participant "LuaApi::Listen\nsrc/LuaApi.cpp" as Api
participant "Sunnet\nsrc/Sunnet.cpp" as Sunnet
participant "Conn表\nSunnet::Conns" as Conns
participant "SocketWorker / epoll\nsrc/SocketWorker.cpp" as Sock
participant "Worker线程" as Worker
participant "Service\nsrc/Service.cpp" as Service
participant "Lua回调\nOnAcceptMsg" as LuaCb

== 创建监听 socket ==

Lua -> Api: sunnet.Listen(port)
activate Api
Api -> Api: 校验 port\n读取 registry.__service_id(selfId)
Api -> Sunnet: Listen(port, selfId)
activate Sunnet
Sunnet -> Sunnet: socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM)\nfcntl(O_NONBLOCK)\nbind(INADDR_ANY:port)\nlisten(backlog=64)

alt 创建 / 绑定 / 监听失败
    Sunnet --> Api: -1
    Api --> Lua: -1
else 成功
    Sunnet -> Conns: AddConn(listenfd, selfId, LISTEN)
    Sunnet -> Sock: AddEvent(listenfd)
    activate Sock
    Sock -> Sock: epoll_ctl(ADD)\nEPOLLIN | EPOLLET
    Sock --> Sunnet
    deactivate Sock
    Sunnet --> Api: listenfd
    deactivate Sunnet
    Api --> Lua: listenfd
end
deactivate Api

== 客户端连接到来 ==

Sock -> Sock: epoll_wait()\nlistenfd 可读
Sock -> Sunnet: GetConn(listenfd)
Sunnet --> Sock: Conn{type=LISTEN, serviceId}
Sock -> Sock: OnAccept(conn)\naccept() 得到 clientfd\nfcntl(clientfd, O_NONBLOCK)
Sock -> Conns: AddConn(clientfd, serviceId, CLIENT)
Sock -> Sock: epoll_ctl(ADD clientfd)\nEPOLLIN | EPOLLET
Sock -> Sunnet: Send(serviceId, SocketAcceptMsg)
note right of Sunnet
这里复用普通 Send 投递逻辑：
目标服务入 msgQueue；
必要时入 globalQueue 并唤醒 worker。
end note

Sunnet -> Worker: globalQueue 中取到目标服务
Worker -> Service: processMsgs(eachNum)
activate Service
Service -> Service: OnMsg(SOCKET_ACCEPT)\nOnAcceptMsg(msg)
Service -> Sunnet: GetConn(clientfd)
Sunnet --> Service: Conn{type=CLIENT}
Service -> Service: 创建 ConnWriter\nwriters[clientfd] = writer
Service -> LuaCb: StartCallbackCoroutine\nOnAcceptMsg(listenfd, clientfd)
activate LuaCb
LuaCb --> Service: LUA_OK 或 LUA_YIELD
deactivate LuaCb
Service --> Worker: 本轮处理结束
deactivate Service

@enduml
